  "source_pdf": "downloads/iron-fans-pattern-parade-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "6949511121362ede16751534d83c5813c0e343355748dc4c1dfdc817b16189ba",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9fca74de3928ecbe5b2362996f6683d84fc2ab09620f8e4ace5f1c5f77c6abc2",
      "text": "铁扇公主的彩旗小麻烦",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "efacc25258fb0238dc5cc6f7aab6407781db86c64f0b20cc01b4d7a2ff4f2153",
      "text": "铁扇公主要办一场小游行。\n院子里拉着一根长长的绳子。\n她说：“我们来挂彩旗吧！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5ac1e330f615815193a03b499772322cc48ca6f26d8cc3a3b99028ca8dd7fc8e",
      "text": "哪吒提来一篮彩旗，\n有红色的，也有金色的。\n悟空把彩旗挂到绳子上。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fb8b7d4231170cf0c5f1a8487325fedf6b150af416bf204fac4b38b3d22d35d8",
      "text": "红、红、金。\n红、红、金。\n公主说：“这是一个规律，\n同样的一组一直重复。”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dac8fc036db7af1e76b41ce4d62da2619f166cd52c2083f22bdedb0d9aa7ff82",
      "text": "一阵小风吹来，\n彩旗轻轻地摆呀摆。\n悟空说：“游行马上要开始了，\n我得快一点！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2c868642438dfd5087efd8f2b4c009d442087f622922cdadad4102aac51f9b4",
      "text": "悟空飞快地抓起彩旗：\n红……金……金！\n“挂好啦！”他大声说。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "18865c1ebffe8c3ef23f4772d51c2ef7fda597e7a2d61a9fe430e49bd6d242af",
      "text": "哪吒往篮子里看了看：\n“还剩一面红旗。\n它是不是也该挂上去？”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "058f2a365659980f4f63488f68c7870d5be413ee1026d64a419a4ba5906de35b",
      "text": "公主说：“我们拍拍手来检查。\n红旗拍手，金旗跺脚。”\n拍、拍、跺！\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "48acd59602bb6b7b48c8a6833e0ab85c34c10694982184efed35813015aa91bc",
      "text": "大家沿着绳子拍：\n拍、拍、跺，拍、拍、跺，\n拍……跺、跺？\n悟空说：“怎么听起来怪怪的！”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e81a4f0faae09a48bb2b0e9d30e39496ebd172de76df74fab2b3da5f9395d85e",
      "text": "他们一组一组地对照：\n红、红、金，一样。\n红、红、金，一样。\n红、金、金，不一样！\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "32fe1fd1293944bbc498bcf1d2df460ead432c44c5650d9ffeba1d493a1fe331",
      "text": "哪吒说：“中间这面应该是红旗。\n因为每一组都一样，\n红旗后面才轮到金旗。”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aec4499cdfce989d289aed160cfdf8b8cc18819925afe8053e370af70b70cf98",
      "text": "悟空把中间那面金旗\n换成了红旗，\n再把金旗放回篮子里。\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a05341b3f8dbc11df430ba83c105114bc7dea72bd6f3d0ebcd9269e29530c491",
      "text": "拍、拍、跺！\n拍、拍、跺！\n拍、拍、跺！\n“现在一直重复到底啦！”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e3277eaf7fd5e295e4a9f503827cec60ad8b09f48339ec311bcc9d77b187b972",
      "text": "游行开始啦！\n公主挥着扇子走在前面，\n哪吒拍着节拍。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2215d057619bfbd6cada5ce956edb1e203a42ea917c4ec2edd7b151a0088c95b",
      "text": "悟空在彩旗下面走：\n踏、踏、甩！\n踏、踏、甩！\n连尾巴也跟上了规律。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2e9f1e595626f0d7bb9e82596337a59606697aa543835efd3485fbfa2de86613",
      "text": "公主问：“下一个是什么？”\n踏、踏……\n大家一起喊：“甩！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
